OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for harassing speed
OL,4,Acamera team
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who carried out a "prolonged
OL,7,Fcampaign of harassment" against a road
OL,8,Fsafety camera team has been given a
OL,9,Ftwo-year restraining order.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police said Paulius
OL,12,FCharitonovas "repeatedly targeted" five
OL,13,Fpeople working as speed enforcement
OL,14,Foperatives across the county between
OL,15,FMarch 2025 and May this year.
OL,17,FAs well as hassling them about their
OL,18,Factivities, he filmed them and posted
OL,19,Fvideos online, which had "a
OL,20,Fconsiderable impact on those affected",
OL,21,Fpolice said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
