OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for harassing speed
OL,4,Acamera team
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharitonovas, 43, of Plantagenet Square
OL,7,Fin Northampton, pleaded guilty to five
OL,8,Fcounts of harassment at the town's
OL,9,Fmagistrates' court, and was also
OL,10,Fsentenced to a 12-month community order
OL,11,Fand 300 hours of unpaid work.
